        "category": "defensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature ends a move action within 30 feet of the ascendant griffon</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The ascendant griffon turns its head to stare down the triggering creature, and attempts to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.2u915NdUyQan6uKF]{Demoralize} it. This use of Demoralize has the visual trait rather than the auditory trait, and the griffon does not take a penalty on its check for not sharing a language.</p>",
