        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The ascendant griffon has a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} in its talons</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The griffon makes a beak Strike to rip at the flesh of its prey. If the Strike hits, that creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} (or increases its drained value by 1, to a maximum of 4).</p>",
